umni/\">Alumni</a></li>\n                    <li><a href=\"https://www.carleton.edu/admissions/\">Prospective Students</a></li>\n                </ul>\n            </li>\n        </ul>\n        <div class=\"search\">\n            <div class=\"alternates\" style=\"display:none\">\n                <!--<a href=\"https://apps.carleton.edu/az/\" title=\"A-Z Guide\">A-Z</a>--><a\n                    href=\"https://www.carleton.edu/directory/\" title=\"Campus Directory\">Directory</a></div>\n            <a href=\"https://www.carleton.edu/search/\" id=\"searchToggle\"><img width=\"14\" height=\"14\" alt=\"Search\"\n                                                                              src=\"data:image/png;base64,\"/></a>\n            <form id=\"bannerSearchForm\" method=\"get\" action=\"https://www.carleton.edu/search/\">\n                <div class=\"basic\"><input type=\"search\" autocomplete=\"off\" id=\"bannerSearch\" name=\"q\"\n                                          placeholder=\"Search People &amp; Pages\"/><input id=\"bannerSearchImage\"\n                                                                                          type=\"image\" width=\"14\"\n                                                                                          height=\"14\" alt=\"Submit\"\n                                                                                          src=\"data:image/png;base64,\"/>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"dialog\" id=\"bannerSearchDialog\">\n                    <div class=\"activeLabel\"><label for=\"bannerSearch\">Search People &amp; Pages</label></div>\n                    <div class=\"scopes\" style=\"display:none\">\n                        <fieldset>\n                            <legend>What Should We Search?</legend>\n                            <label><input type=\"radio\" checked=\"checked\" name=\"scope\" value=\"\"/> Search all of\n                                Carleton.edu</label>\n                    