 link you clicked or the URL you typed in didn't work for\n                    some reason.</h3>\n                <p>This is best known as a <strong>404</strong> error. Here are some of the reasons why\n                    that might have happened:</p>\n                <ul>\n                    <li>We might have a bad link on one of our pages, which sent you to the wrong\n                        place when you clicked it.\n                    </li>\n                    <li>You might have typed in the web address incorrectly.</li>\n                    <li>Someone might have sent you a message that had an incorrect web address.</li>\n                    <li>Our server could be having problems.</li>\n                </ul>\n\n                <h3>What were you looking for?</h3>\n                <form action=\"https://www.carleton.edu/search/\" method=\"get\" class=\"form\">\n                    <p>\n                        <label for=\"combinedSearchInput\" class=\"form__label\">Search people and pages:</label>\n                        <input type=\"text\" id=\"combinedSearchInputBody\" name=\"q\" size=\"18\" class=\"form__input\">\n                        <input type=\"submit\" id=\"combinedSearchSubmitBody\" value=\"Search\"\n                               class=\"button--solid form__button\">\n                    </p>\n                </form>\n                <p>If you think that there's a bad link on a page, please go back to the page that\n                    had the link, and there should be contact information for the person who maintains\n                    it at the bottom of the page. Please contact them (email is always\n                    good) and let them know about the problem!</p>\n                <p>If you can't figure out whom to contact, you can send an email to <a\n                        href=\"mailto:webmaster@carleton.edu\">webmaster@carleton.edu</a>.\n                    Make sure to let us know where the bad link was located. Thanks!</p>\n                <p class=\"maintained\">Maintained by <a href=\"https://www.carleton.edu/web-services/\">Web\n                    Services</a><br><br></p>\n            </main>\n            <div id=\"navigation\" class=\"navigation\">\n                <div id=\"navInnerWrap\" class=\"hasNav noSubNav\">\n                    <nav id=\"minisiteNavigation\" role=\"navigation\" aria-label=\"page\">\n                        <div class=\"list\">\n                            <ul class=\"navListTop\">\n                                <li class=\"navListItem open noJump current\"><a href=\"/\"> Carleton College Home </a>\n                                </li>\n                            </ul>\n                        </div>\n                    </nav>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <footer id=\"footer\" role=\"contentinfo\">\n        <div class=\"module1\">\n            <div id=\"maintained\">\n                <hr>\n                <div class=\"siteInfo siteInfo--simple\">\n                    <div id=\"maintainer\">Carleton College pages maintained by <a href=\"mailto:web@carleton.edu\">the Web\n                        Team</a></div>\n                    <div id=\"lastUpdated\">This page was last updated on <span\n                            class=\"lastUpdated__date\">3 October 2024</span></div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </footer>\n\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"carletonFooter__wrapper\">\n    <footer class=\"carletonFooter\" role=\"contentinfo\">\n        <div class=\"carletonFooter__innerWrap\">\n            <div class=\"carletonFooter__identity\">\n                <div class=\"carletonFooter__logo\"><a href=\"https://www.carleton.edu\"><img\n                        src=\"https://www.carleton.edu/wp-content/themes/standard-theme/images/footer/carleton-logo-c-ray-left.png\"\n                        alt=\"Carleton\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></div>\n                <div class=\"carletonFooter__contact\">